Upstream pin is in UPSTREAM. include/apostrophe.h carries a Zlyme my355
change: map Flip buttons with NextUI JOY_* joystick indices. Stock
Apostrophe treats the Flip as keyboard scancodes only; this image's
rocknix joypad emits joystick BTN_* events, which ScrapeGoat and
Moonlight need in order to see A/B/D-pad.
